        835.0,
        1058.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "which is independent of the arbitrary vector c. Likewise, a vector of contrasts Bx has a unique solution $ \\mathbf{B}\\mathbf{A}^{-}\\mathbf{y} $, provided B satisfies $ \\mathbf{B}\\mathbf{A}^{-}\\mathbf{A}=\\mathbf{B} $",
